IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `types`
IMPORT `chapter-2-explanations`
IMPORT `chapter-4-exceptions`

§ `Chapter 17 -- Cheating`

-- Penal Code 1871 ss 415, 416, 416B, 417, 418, 419, 420, 420A.
-- Source: registers/source-bundle/PC1871.txt.

§§ `Section 415 -- Cheating`

-- Whoever, by deceiving any person, whether or not such deception was the sole
-- or main inducement, fraudulently or dishonestly induces the person so deceived
-- to deliver or cause the delivery of any property to any person, or to consent
-- that any person shall retain any property, or intentionally induces the person
-- so deceived to do or omit to do anything which he would not do or omit to do
-- if he were not so deceived, and which act or omission causes or is likely to
-- cause damage or harm to any person in body, mind, reputation or property.

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 415"
GIVEN d IS A Deception
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `there is a qualifying harm` IF
        d's `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to body`
    OR  d's `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to mind`
    OR  d's `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to reputation`
    OR  d's `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to property`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 415"
GIVEN d IS A Deception
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `there is a property inducement` IF
        d's `fraudulently or dishonestly induces delivery of property`
    OR  d's `fraudulently or dishonestly induces consent that any person retain property`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 415"
GIVEN d IS A Deception
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `there is a harmful act or omission inducement` IF
        d's `intentionally induces an act or omission the deceived would not otherwise do`
    AND `there is a qualifying harm` d

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 415"
@export Decide whether the deception constitutes cheating under Penal Code 1871 section 415
GIVEN d IS A Deception @desc The deception facts. Deceives a person is required. Whether the deception was the sole or main inducement is irrelevant (s 415). Then either a fraudulent or dishonest property inducement, or an intentional inducement of an act or omission causing or likely to cause harm to body, mind, reputation or property.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes cheating` IF
        d's `deceives a person`
    AND (   `there is a property inducement` d
         OR `there is a harmful act or omission inducement` d)

§§ `Section 416 -- Cheating by personation`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 416"
@export Decide whether the deception is cheating by personation under Penal Code 1871 section 416
GIVEN d IS A Deception @desc Cheating plus pretending to be some other person, knowingly substituting one person for another, or representing that a person is a person other than that person really is. The personated individual may be real or imaginary.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes cheating by personation` IF
        `constitutes cheating` d
    AND (   d's `pretends to be some other person`
         OR d's `knowingly substitutes one person for another`
         OR d's `represents that a person is a person other than that person really is`)

§§ `Section 416B -- Cheating by remote communication`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 416B"
@export Decide whether the deception is cheating by remote communication under Penal Code 1871 section 416B
GIVEN d IS A Deception @desc Cheating where the deception is conducted mainly by way of remote communication: the Internet, telephone or other communication device, television or radio, or other electronic or other technology for facilitating communication.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes cheating by remote communication` IF
        `constitutes cheating` d
    AND NOT (d's `remote channel` EQUALS `not remote`)
    AND d's `the deception is conducted mainly by way of remote communication`

§§ `Section 418 -- Cheating a person whose interest the offender is bound to protect`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 418"
GIVEN d IS A Deception
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes section 418 cheating` IF
        `constitutes cheating` d
    AND d's `knows the cheating is likely to cause wrongful loss to a person whose interest the actor was bound to protect`

§§ `Section 420 -- Cheating and dishonestly inducing a delivery of property`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 420(1)"
@export Decide whether the deception is cheating that dishonestly induces delivery of property under Penal Code 1871 section 420
GIVEN d IS A Deception @desc Cheating plus dishonestly inducing delivery of property, or making alteration or destruction of a valuable security. s 420(2) applies where this is also cheating by remote communication.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes section 420 cheating` IF
        `constitutes cheating` d
    AND (   d's `dishonestly induces delivery of property`
         OR d's `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of the whole or any part of a valuable security`
         OR d's `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of anything signed or sealed and capable of being converted into a valuable security`)

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 420(2)"
GIVEN d IS A Deception
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes section 420 cheating by remote communication` IF
        `constitutes section 420 cheating` d
    AND `constitutes cheating by remote communication` d

§§ `Section 420A -- Obtaining services dishonestly or fraudulently`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 420A"
@export Decide whether services are obtained dishonestly or fraudulently under Penal Code 1871 section 420A
GIVEN s IS A `Services Obtained` @desc The services facts. Requires obtaining services, that they are made available on a payment basis, obtaining without payment or without payment in full, knowledge of that basis, and intention that payment will not be made or will not be made in full.
      f IS A Fault @desc Fault elements used to decide whether the obtaining is dishonest (s 24) or fraudulent (s 25).
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes obtaining services dishonestly or fraudulently` IF
        (   `the act is done dishonestly` f
         OR `the act is done fraudulently` f)
    AND s's `obtains services for self or another`
    AND s's `the services are made available on the basis that payment has been is being or will be made`
    AND s's `obtains the services without payment or without payment in full`
    AND s's `when obtaining knows they are or might be made available on that payment basis`
    AND s's `when obtaining intends that payment will not be made or will not be made in full`

§§ `Proposed Act wrappers`

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes cheating` IF
        `constitutes cheating` (a's `deception`)
    AND NOT (`a general exception applies` a)

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes cheating by personation` IF
        `constitutes cheating by personation` (a's `deception`)
    AND NOT (`a general exception applies` a)

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes cheating by remote communication` IF
        `constitutes cheating by remote communication` (a's `deception`)
    AND NOT (`a general exception applies` a)

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes section 420 cheating` IF
        `constitutes section 420 cheating` (a's `deception`)
    AND NOT (`a general exception applies` a)

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes obtaining services dishonestly or fraudulently` IF
        `constitutes obtaining services dishonestly or fraudulently` (a's `services obtained`) (a's `fault`)
    AND NOT (`a general exception applies` a)

§§ `Illustrations`

`classic property cheating` MEANS Deception WITH
    `deceives a person` IS TRUE
    `deception was the sole or main inducement` IS FALSE
    `is a dishonest concealment of facts` IS FALSE
    `is a mere breach of contract` IS FALSE
    `the deceived is a company association or body of persons` IS FALSE
    `an individual officer employee or agent of the deceived was personally deceived` IS TRUE
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS TRUE
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces consent that any person retain property` IS FALSE
    `intentionally induces an act or omission the deceived would not otherwise do` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to body` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to mind` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to reputation` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to property` IS FALSE
    `pretends to be some other person` IS FALSE
    `knowingly substitutes one person for another` IS FALSE
    `represents that a person is a person other than that person really is` IS FALSE
    `remote channel` IS `not remote`
    `the deception is conducted mainly by way of remote communication` IS FALSE
    `knows the cheating is likely to cause wrongful loss to a person whose interest the actor was bound to protect` IS FALSE
    `dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS TRUE
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of the whole or any part of a valuable security` IS FALSE
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of anything signed or sealed and capable of being converted into a valuable security` IS FALSE

`no deception` MEANS Deception WITH
    `deceives a person` IS FALSE
    `deception was the sole or main inducement` IS FALSE
    `is a dishonest concealment of facts` IS FALSE
    `is a mere breach of contract` IS FALSE
    `the deceived is a company association or body of persons` IS FALSE
    `an individual officer employee or agent of the deceived was personally deceived` IS FALSE
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS TRUE
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces consent that any person retain property` IS FALSE
    `intentionally induces an act or omission the deceived would not otherwise do` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to body` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to mind` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to reputation` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to property` IS FALSE
    `pretends to be some other person` IS FALSE
    `knowingly substitutes one person for another` IS FALSE
    `represents that a person is a person other than that person really is` IS FALSE
    `remote channel` IS `not remote`
    `the deception is conducted mainly by way of remote communication` IS FALSE
    `knows the cheating is likely to cause wrongful loss to a person whose interest the actor was bound to protect` IS FALSE
    `dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS TRUE
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of the whole or any part of a valuable security` IS FALSE
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of anything signed or sealed and capable of being converted into a valuable security` IS FALSE

`internet cheating of a company` MEANS Deception WITH
    `deceives a person` IS TRUE
    `deception was the sole or main inducement` IS FALSE
    `is a dishonest concealment of facts` IS FALSE
    `is a mere breach of contract` IS FALSE
    `the deceived is a company association or body of persons` IS TRUE
    `an individual officer employee or agent of the deceived was personally deceived` IS FALSE
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS TRUE
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces consent that any person retain property` IS FALSE
    `intentionally induces an act or omission the deceived would not otherwise do` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to body` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to mind` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to reputation` IS FALSE
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to property` IS FALSE
    `pretends to be some other person` IS FALSE
    `knowingly substitutes one person for another` IS FALSE
    `represents that a person is a person other than that person really is` IS FALSE
    `remote channel` IS `the Internet`
    `the deception is conducted mainly by way of remote communication` IS TRUE
    `knows the cheating is likely to cause wrongful loss to a person whose interest the actor was bound to protect` IS FALSE
    `dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS TRUE
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of the whole or any part of a valuable security` IS FALSE
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of anything signed or sealed and capable of being converted into a valuable security` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `constitutes cheating` `classic property cheating`
#ASSERT NOT (`constitutes cheating` `no deception`)
#ASSERT `constitutes cheating by remote communication` `internet cheating of a company`
#ASSERT `constitutes section 420 cheating` `classic property cheating`
#ASSERT `constitutes section 420 cheating by remote communication` `internet cheating of a company`
#ASSERT NOT (`constitutes cheating by personation` `classic property cheating`)
